OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTurning
OL,6,Fdrier for a time, before a further
OL,7,Fband of heavier rain arrives from the
OL,8,Fsouthwest. Some mist and a chance of
OL,9,Ffog forming. Winds remaining light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FMisty start with further
OL,12,Frain and drizzle affecting most areas.
OL,13,FPossibly turning drier later and winds
OL,14,Fremaining light.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FTurning
OL,17,Flargely dry with some sunshine Friday
OL,18,Fand Saturday but a few coastal
OL,19,Fshowers. Temperatures near or below
OL,20,Fnormal. Mostly light winds. Cloudier
OL,21,Fwith rain likely later on Sunday.
